{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosie is a horror adventure game that takes place inside multiple virtual pop-up books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rosie. A 6-year-old who lives with her family at the top of the hill of a small town. The townsfolk avoid the family, as they claim to see ghosts and demons. Rosie is starting to question this for herself. Help Rosie discover different paths she can take and decide her ultimate fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are ghosts and demons real? Or is it all in the family\u2019s head? Decide for yourself as you unravel the mysteries of the world through quests and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and World Exploration:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unlock new areas. Discover story elements. Interact with environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and Whimsical Visuals:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a02D characters and cutesy drawn interactable inside a book like 3D world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Decide the ending after experimenting with decisions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Golden Hat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963630/e107bfd6b61b2e36b8a298de9eddc8a45599aa75.jpg"},{"name":"It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963630/238e050e04283769a083f4acd739486e4b6d7c75.jpg"},{"name":"Return Stuffy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963630/cc943425eb3cd41ff330ae986f981b2497e230e7.jpg"},{"name":"In Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun